# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![Output of the previous code cell](/learning/images/courses/quantum-machine-learning/qvc-qnn/extracted-outputs/05c6f664-4043-446c-8fcc-11e77d6fe280-0.avif)\n"
